Elegant abstract composition of a single large soft sphere of burnished gold light rising from the bottom center, its glow bleeding into a polished metallic sheen across a deep forest green to near-black gradient. Faint concentric ripples of ivory light radiate outward, and the upper region stays calm and dark. Fine film grain and velvet-smooth falloff create a refined, trophy-room warmth. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups